{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "The search results indicate that Barrett Business Services, Inc. (BBSI) held its 2024 Annual Meeting of Stockholders on **June 3, 2024**. According to proxy voting disclosures from institutional investors like the New York State Teachers' Retirement System (NYSTRS) and the New York State Common Retirement Fund, the following individuals were nominated for election to the Board of Directors at that meeting:\n\n*   **Thomas J. Carley**\n*   **Thomas B. Cusick**\n*   **James B. Hicks**\n*   **Gary E. Kramer**\n*   **Carla A. Moradi**\n*   **Vincent Price**\n\nThese nominees were presented for election as directors to serve until the 2025 Annual Meeting of Stockholders.\n\nFINAL ANSWER: For the 2024 Annual Meeting of Stockholders held on June 3, 2024, the following individuals were nominated to serve on the Board of Directors of Barrett Business Services, Inc. (BBSI): Thomas J. Carley, Thomas B. Cusick, James B. Hicks, Gary E. Kramer, Carla A. Moradi, and Vincent Price.\n\n{\n    \"sources\": [\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.nystrs.org/getmedia/f74928f2-9382-4f72-adfd-1a65f208b48e/vote_disclosure_6-30-24.PDF\",\n            \"name\": \"NYSTRS Proxy Vote Disclosure Report Jan. 1-June 30, 2024\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.osc.ny.gov/files/common-retirement-fund/corporate-governance/pdf/proxy-voting-2024.pdf\",\n            \"name\": \"Office of the New York State Comptroller - Proxy Voting Report 2024\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://ir.bbsi.com/sec-filings/all-sec-filings/content/0000950170-25-056288/0000950170-25-056288.pdf\",\n            \"name\": \"BBSI 2024 Annual Report (Form 10-K)\"\n        }\n    ]\n}", "final_reason": "single_agent", "retrieved_docids": ["0000950170", "056288", "1", "10", "2", "2024", "208", "24", "25", "30", "4", "48", "6", "65", "72", "74928", "9382"], "status": 